    "body": "# What does this PR do ?\r\n\r\nBump the pinned nvidia-modelopt override from 0.46.0rc1 to the official 0.47.0 release.\r\n\r\n# Changelog\r\n\r\n- Update the override in `pyproject.toml`.\r\n- Update only the ModelOpt override, version, and wheel URL/hash in `uv.lock`. No other locked packages change.\r\n- ModelOpt’s base dependencies are unchanged from 0.46.0rc1.\r\n\r\n# GitHub Actions CI\r\n\r\nCI is pending. Local validation passed: `uv lock --check --offline` with uv 0.7.2 and `pre-commit run --all-files`.\r\n\r\n# Before your PR is \"Ready for review\"\r\n\r\n**Pre checks**:\r\n\r\n- [x] Read the [Contributor guidelines](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\r\n- [x] No new tests are needed for this dependency-only change.\r\n- [x] No documentation change is needed.\r\n- [x] No imports or optional-install guards change.\r\n  - [ ] Reviewer: Confirm optional-library import guards remain appropriate.\r\n\r\n# Additional Information\r\n\r\n- ModelOpt [0.47.0 release](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Model-Optimizer/releases/tag/0.47.0).\r\n",
